# Not committed: this lockfile was generated on a Windows dev machine and
# only pins the Windows-specific optional native binary for Vite 8's
# Rolldown bundler. Railway's Linux build container needs the
# linux-x64-gnu binary instead, which a Windows-frozen lockfile doesn't
# include -- npm won't re-resolve it correctly even via `npm install`
# once a lockfile exists (npm/cli#4828). Committing this again from a
# Windows machine will reintroduce that build failure.
package-lock.json

